    <body>
      <p><seg source="#source-244-291">琺瑯の野外の空に　明けの鳥一つ</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-291-344">阿爾加里性水溶液にて　この身を洗へ</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-344-353">蟷螂は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-353-371"><rb>眼</rb><rt>まなこ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-371-409">光らせ　露しげき叢を出づ</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-409-434">わが手は　緑玉製 </seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-434-453"><rb>Isis</rb><rt>イジス</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-453-457"> の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-457-469"><rb>御</rb><rt>み</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-469-481">膝の上に</seg></p>
    </body>
